#!markdown

# 03 · Genome browser and plots

**EN** — Build a static genome-browser view (ruler, gene models with exons/UTRs/strand, features, coverage, variant lollipops), then export it as PNG, SVG and HTML. Every plot uses the shared Biotech.Net theme (light or dark).

**ID** — Membuat tampilan genome browser statis (penggaris, model gen dengan ekson/UTR/arah untai, fitur, cakupan, lollipop varian), lalu mengekspornya ke PNG, SVG, dan HTML. Semua plot memakai tema Biotech.Net yang sama (terang atau gelap).

*Dibuat oleh Gravicode Studios dipimpin oleh Kang Fadhil*

#!csharp

#r "nuget: Gravicode.Biotech.Net.Notebooks, 0.2.0"
// Local build instead of NuGet (run `dotnet build Biotech.Net.slnx` first), comment the line above and use:
// #r "../src/Biotech.Net.Notebooks/bin/Debug/net10.0/Biotech.Net.Notebooks.dll"

#!csharp

using Biotech.Net.Core;
using Biotech.Net.Visualization;
using Biotech.Net.Notebooks;

BiotechFormatters.Register();

#!markdown

## A small annotated region · Wilayah beranotasi kecil

Intervals are 0-based half-open; variants use 1-based positions.
Interval berbasis 0 setengah-terbuka; varian memakai posisi berbasis 1.

#!csharp

var region = GenomicInterval.Parse("chr1:1,001-6,000");

var alpha = new Gene("G1", new GenomicInterval("chr1", 1200, 3400, Strand.Forward), "ALPHA");
alpha.Transcripts.Add(new Transcript("ALPHA-201", "G1",
    [new("chr1", 1200, 1500, Strand.Forward), new("chr1", 2000, 2300, Strand.Forward), new("chr1", 3000, 3400, Strand.Forward)])
    { CodingRegion = new GenomicInterval("chr1", 1350, 3200, Strand.Forward) });
alpha.Transcripts.Add(new Transcript("ALPHA-202", "G1",
    [new("chr1", 1200, 1500, Strand.Forward), new("chr1", 3000, 3400, Strand.Forward)])
    { CodingRegion = new GenomicInterval("chr1", 1350, 3200, Strand.Forward) });
var beta = new Gene("G2", new GenomicInterval("chr1", 3800, 5600, Strand.Reverse), "BETA-AS1", "lncRNA");
beta.Transcripts.Add(new Transcript("BETA-AS1-201", "G2", [new("chr1", 3800, 4200, Strand.Reverse), new("chr1", 5000, 5600, Strand.Reverse)]));

var depth = Enumerable.Range(0, 5000).Select(i => 25 + 12 * Math.Sin(i / 280.0) + (i is > 1200 and < 1500 ? 35 : 0)).ToArray();

var variants = new List<Variant>
{
    new("chr1", 1400, "A", "G", "rs1001"),
    new("chr1", 2101, "C", "T"),
    new("chr1", 4000, "AT", "A"),
    new("chr1", 5200, "G", "GTT") { Filter = "LowQual" },
};

var promoter = new SequenceFeature("promoter", FeatureLocation.Span(1050, 1200, Strand.Forward)).With("label", "P_alpha");

var browser = new GenomeBrowser(region, width: 1000) { Title = "ALPHA locus" }
    .AddRuler()
    .AddGenes([alpha, beta])
    .AddFeatures([promoter])
    .AddCoverage(depth, start: 1000, name: "RNA-seq depth")
    .AddVariants(variants);
browser

#!markdown

## Export · Ekspor

#!csharp

browser.Save("alpha-locus.png");
browser.Save("alpha-locus.svg");
browser.Save("alpha-locus.html");
browser.Theme = BioTheme.Dark;
browser

#!markdown

## Heatmap with clustering · Heatmap dengan klasterisasi

Rows are z-scored, then rows and columns are clustered (average linkage) and drawn with dendrograms.
Baris di-z-score, lalu baris dan kolom diklaster (average linkage) dan digambar dengan dendrogram.

#!csharp

var rng = new Random(3);
var values = new double[30, 8];
for (int i = 0; i < 30; i++)
    for (int j = 0; j < 8; j++)
        values[i, j] = rng.NextDouble() + ((i < 15) == (j < 4) ? 3 : 0);

new Heatmap(values, Enumerable.Range(1, 30).Select(i => $"gene{i}").ToArray(), Enumerable.Range(1, 8).Select(i => $"S{i}").ToArray())
{
    Title = "Expression (z-score)",
    ColumnGroups = ["ctl", "ctl", "ctl", "ctl", "trt", "trt", "trt", "trt"],
}

#!csharp

// Plots are also static images on demand · Plot juga bisa berupa gambar statis
HTML(BiotechHtml.Plot(new SequenceLogo(new[] { "ACGTG", "ACGTA", "ACGTG", "TCGTG" }), PlotEmbedding.Png))
